recommend keep-going the Monocypher-SOURCE byte-for-byte parity rung for Elligator (a C harness linking crypto_elligator_map/rev + a Rye harness over the module, diffed) is the next Rye-first crux — the SEVENTEENTH parity rung, its own signed round; then Elligator key_pair (needs x25519_dirty_fast) or SLH-DSA (gated on FIPS 205 KATs — a check-in).
